Package: qore-ncurses-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: ncurses-term
Suggests: qore-ncurses-module-doc
Description: terminal user interfaces and interactive REPL for Qore
 This package provides the native wide-character ncurses module, NcursesUi
 widget toolkit, NcursesReplUi helpers and the qrepl interactive shell.
 Source and compiled modules and compiler metadata are included.

Package: qore-ncurses-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-ncurses-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's terminal UI modules
 This package contains the HTML API references and example tests for the
 native terminal module, NcursesUi and NcursesReplUi.
